DFD LEVEL 1 DESCRIPTION (PLACEHOLDER CONTENT)

Process 1.0: Authentication and Authorization
Inputs:
- username, password
- registration request (admin)
Outputs:
- JWT token
- auth status/errors
Data store used:
- User data

Process 2.0: Student Management
Inputs:
- add/update/delete student
- student search/filter parameters
Outputs:
- student records
- operation status
Data store used:
- Student data

Process 3.0: Face Detection and Recognition
Inputs:
- camera frames
- face encodings
Outputs:
- recognized student IDs with confidence
Data store/file used:
- Encodings model/data

Process 4.0: Attendance Processing
Inputs:
- AI attendance payload
- manual attendance request
Outputs:
- attendance save status
- updated attendance entries
Data store used:
- Attendance data

Process 5.0: Reporting and Summary
Inputs:
- date/student filters
Outputs:
- attendance list
- present/absent summary
Data store used:
- Attendance + Student data

Entity interactions:
- Admin/Teacher interact with 1.0, 2.0, 4.0, 5.0
- Camera/AI interacts with 3.0 and 4.0
